{"parse":{"title":"A Wager of Moonlight","pageid":408999,"revid":2103525,"redirects":[],"text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title\">A Wager of Moonlight</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/f/f3/Talent_A_Wager_of_Moonlight.png/revision/latest?cb=20251022045613\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Talent A Wager of Moonlight\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/f/f3/Talent_A_Wager_of_Moonlight.png/revision/latest?cb=20251022045613\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/f/f3/Talent_A_Wager_of_Moonlight.png/revision/latest?cb=20251022045613 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/f/f3/Talent_A_Wager_of_Moonlight.png/revision/latest?cb=20251022045613 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Talent A Wager of Moonlight\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\" data-image-key=\"Talent_A_Wager_of_Moonlight.png\" data-image-name=\"Talent A Wager of Moonlight.png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"character\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Char­ac­ter</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Nefer\" title=\"Nefer\">Nefer</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"type\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Talent Type</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/1st_Ascension_Passive\" title=\"1st Ascension Passive\">1st Ascension Passive</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"type\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Category</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ascension_Talent\" title=\"Ascension Talent\">Ascension</a></div>\n</div>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-panel pi-border-color wds-tabber\">\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"wds-tabs\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tInfo\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDetails\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"info\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Nefer will be granted the corresponding buff effects based on the <a href=\"/wiki/Party\" title=\"Party\">party</a>'s Moonsign.<br /><br /><b>Moonsign: Ascendant Gleam</b>: When she unleashes her Elemental Skill <a href=\"/wiki/Senet_Strategy:_Dance_of_a_Thousand_Nights\" title=\"Senet Strategy: Dance of a Thousand Nights\">Senet Strategy: Dance of a Thousand Nights</a>, any Dendro Cores on the field will be converted to Seeds of Deceit, and any Lunar-Bloom reactions triggered by nearby characters in the following 15s that would create Dendro Cores or Bountiful Cores will instead create Seeds of Deceit. Seeds of Deceit cannot trigger Hyperbloom or Burgeon reactions and will not burst.<br />When Nefer unleashes a Charged Attack or <span class=\"custom-tt-wrapper giw-extra-effect-wrapper toggle-tooltip mw-collapsible mw-made-collapsible mw-collapsed giw-collapsible\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle mw-collapsible-toggle-default mw-collapsible-toggle-collapsed giw-extra-effect toggle-tooltip\">Phantasm Performance</span><span class=\"mw-collapsible-content giw-extra-effect\" style=\"display:none\"><span class=\"giw-extra-effect-header\">Phantasm Performance</span><span class=\"giw-extra-effect-content\">When in the Shadow Dance state caused by her Elemental Skill Senet Strategy: Dance of a Thousand Nights, if you have at least 1 Verdant Dew, Nefer's Charged Attacks will be replaced with the special Charged Attack Phantasm Performance, which will not consume Stamina.<br />Nefer summons shades of herself to perform Coordinated Attacks against enemies. Nefer and the shades will deal 2 and 3 stages of <span class=\"text-dendro\"><b>AoE Dendro DMG</b></span> respectively. DMG dealt by the shades is considered Lunar-Bloom DMG. 1 Verdant Dew will be consumed the first time shades are summoned after every Phantasm Performance.</span></span></span>, she can absorb Seeds of Deceit within a certain range, gaining 1 stack of <span class=\"custom-tt-wrapper giw-extra-effect-wrapper toggle-tooltip mw-collapsible mw-made-collapsible mw-collapsed giw-collapsible\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle mw-collapsible-toggle-default mw-collapsible-toggle-collapsed giw-extra-effect toggle-tooltip\">Veil of Falsehood</span><span class=\"mw-collapsible-content giw-extra-effect\" style=\"display:none\"><span class=\"giw-extra-effect-header\">Veil of Falsehood</span><span class=\"giw-extra-effect-content\">After absorbing Seeds of Deceit via the Ascension Talent A Wager of Moonlight, Nefer gains this effect, thereby increasing the DMG dealt by her Phantasm Performance.<br />Each stack of Veil of Falsehood increases the DMG dealt by Nefer's Phantasm Performance by 8%. The initial maximum number of stacks is 3, with each stack lasting for 9s (each stack's duration is counted independently).</span></span></span> for every seed absorbed. When this effect reaches 3 stacks, or when the third stack's duration is refreshed, Nefer's <a href=\"/wiki/Elemental_Mastery\" title=\"Elemental Mastery\">Elemental Mastery</a> will be increased by 100 for 8s.</div>\n</div>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"utility1\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><b>Utility</b><ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Elemental_Mastery\" title=\"Elemental Mastery\">Elemental Mastery</a></li></ul></div>\n</div>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<b>A Wager of Moonlight</b> is <a href=\"/wiki/Nefer\" title=\"Nefer\">Nefer</a>'s <a href=\"/wiki/1st_Ascension_Passive\" title=\"1st Ascension Passive\">1st Ascension Passive</a>.\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Other_Languages\">Other Languages</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fgenshin-impact.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FA_Wager_of_Moonlight%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"article-table\">\n<tbody><tr><th>Language</th><th>Official Name</th><th>Literal Meaning</th></tr><tr><td><b>English</b></td><td>A Wager of Moonlight</td><td>&#8212;</td></tr><tr><td><b>Chinese<br /><small>(Simplified)</small></b></td><td><span lang=\"zh-Hans\">月下的豪赌</span><br /><small><i><span lang=\"zh-rm\"></span></i></small></td><td rowspan=\"2\">Heavy Gambling Under the Moonlight</td></tr><tr><td><b>Chinese<br /><small>(Traditional)</small></b></td><td><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">月下的豪賭</span><br /><small><i><span lang=\"zh-rm\"></span></i></small></td></tr><tr><td><b>Japanese</b></td><td><span lang=\"ja\">月下の賭け</span><br /><small><i>Gekka no Kake</i></small></td><td>Wager Under the Moon</td></tr><tr><td><b>Korean</b></td><td><span lang=\"ko\">달빛</span> <span lang=\"ko\">승부사</span><br /><small><i>Dalbit Seungbusa</i></small></td><td>Moonlight Adventurer</td></tr><tr><td><b>Spanish</b></td><td>Apuesta bajo la luna</td><td>Wager Under the Moon</td></tr><tr><td><b>French</b></td><td>Pari au clair de lune</td><td>Wager in the Moonlight</td></tr><tr><td><b>Russian</b></td><td><span lang=\"ru\">Пари</span> <span lang=\"ru\">лунного</span> <span lang=\"ru\">света</span><br /><small><i>Pari lunnogo sveta</i></small></td><td></td></tr><tr><td><b>Thai</b></td><td>A Wager of Moonlight</td><td>&#8212;</td></tr><tr><td><b>Vietnamese</b></td><td><span lang=\"vi\">Đánh Cược Dưới Trăng</span></td><td></td></tr><tr><td><b>German</b></td><td>Gl<span lang=\"de\">ü</span>cksspiel im Mondschein</td><td>Gambling in the Moonlight</td></tr><tr><td><b>Indonesian</b></td><td>A Wager of Moonlight</td><td>&#8212;</td></tr><tr><td><b>Portuguese</b></td><td>Aposta Sob o Luar</td><td></td></tr><tr><td><b>Turkish</b></td><td>Ay I<span lang=\"tr\">şığı</span>na Bahis</td><td></td></tr><tr><td><b>Italian</b></td><td>Scommessa al chiaro di luna</td><td></td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Change_History\">Change History</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fgenshin-impact.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FA_Wager_of_Moonlight%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal