_of_a_Thousand_Nights.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/c/c0/Talent_Senet_Strategy_Dance_of_a_Thousand_Nights.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/60?cb=20251022045609\" /></a></span><br /><a href=\"/wiki/Senet_Strategy:_Dance_of_a_Thousand_Nights\" title=\"Senet Strategy: Dance of a Thousand Nights\">Senet Strategy: Dance of a Thousand Nights</a></td><td style=\"vertical-align: top;\"><small>Elemental </small><br /><b>Burst</b><br /><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sacred_Vow:_True_Eye%27s_Phantasm\" title=\"Sacred Vow: True Eye&#39;s Phantasm\"><img alt=\"Talent Sacred Vow True Eye&#39;s Phantasm\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"60\" height=\"60\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Talent Sacred Vow True Eye&#39;s Phantasm.png\" data-image-key=\"Talent_Sacred_Vow_True_Eye%27s_Phantasm.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/c/c2/Talent_Sacred_Vow_True_Eye%27s_Phantasm.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/60?cb=20251022045611\" /></a></span><br /><a href=\"/wiki/Sacred_Vow:_True_Eye%27s_Phantasm\" title=\"Sacred Vow: True Eye&#39;s Phantasm\">Sacred Vow: True Eye's Phantasm</a></td><td style=\"vertical-align: top;\"><small>1st Ascension </small><br /><b>Passive</b><br /><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/A_Wager_of_Moonlight\" title=\"A Wager of Moonlight\"><img alt=\"Talent A Wager of Moonlight\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"60\" height=\"60\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Talent A Wager of Moonlight.png\" data-image-key=\"Talent_A_Wager_of_Moonlight.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/f/f3/Talent_A_Wager_of_Moonlight.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/60?cb=20251022045613\" /></a></span><br /><strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">A Wager of Moonlight</strong></td><td style=\"vertical-align: top;\"><small>4th Ascension </small><br /><b>Passive</b><br /><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Daughter_of_the_Dust_and_Sand\" title=\"Daughter of the Dust and Sand\"><img alt=\"Talent Daughter of the Dust and Sand\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"60\" height=\"60\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Talent Daughter of the Dust and Sand.png\" data-image-key=\"Talent_Daughter_of_the_Dust_and_Sand.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/0/01/Talent_Daughter_of_the_Dust_and_Sand.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/60?cb=20251022045615\" /></a></span><br /><a href=\"/wiki/Daughter_of_the_Dust_and_Sand\" title=\"Daughter of the Dust and Sand\">Daughter of the Dust and Sand</a></td><td style=\"vertical-align: top;\"><small>Moonsign Benediction </small><br /><b>Passive</b><br /><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Dusklit_Eaves\" title=\"Dusklit Eaves\"><img alt=\"Talent Dendro Moonsign Lunar-Bloom\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"60\" height=\"60\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Talent Dendro Moonsign Lunar-Bloom.png\" data-image-key=\"Talent_Dendro_Moonsign_Lunar-Bloom.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/b/b4/Talent_Dendro_Moonsign_Lunar-Bloom.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/60?cb=20250910024347\" /></a></span><br /><a href=\"/wiki/Dusklit_Eaves\" title=\"Dusklit Eaves\">Dusklit Eaves</a></td><td style=\"vertical-alig